Upstream Mesa fixes that apply to the Adreno 830 (chip 0x44050001: a7xx_base, a7xx_gen3, a8xx_base, a8xx_gen1), backported onto the
pinned 85fda3b after turnip-a8xx-backports.patch:
  99fed09b tu: Add missing WFI to tu6_clear_lrz() (Cc: mesa-stable)
  189ee824 ir3: add quirk for prefetch sam.s2en needing helpers (a7xx_base; the A830 keeps FS texture prefetch on)
  84f09016 ir3: Don't use alias.tex inside predt/predf/prede sequence (QCTDD11183148, a7xx_base; main leaves it on for a8xx_base),
           without its parent 963e3551 (the alias.tex/mova quirk, which main turns off for a8xx_base): alias_srcs() keeps its pinned form
  c503b0a1 freedreno/ir3: Implement QCTDD13523866 quirk (a7xx_gen3)
  a08a0b93 ir3: fix QCTDD13523866 workaround (with main's foreach_block_from/foreach_main_block iterators)
85fda3b has no quirks section (a3c6dff6 came later), so the three quirks are props fields like every other pinned quirk:
alias_predication_quirk, prefetch_sam_helpers_quirk and QCTDD13523866_dummy_alu (FD_DEV_FEATURES=<name>=0 turns one off).

diff --git a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_dev_info.h b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_dev_info.h
index 4302b8a..bfc3d1a 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_dev_info.h
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_dev_info.h
@@ -488,6 +488,23 @@ struct fd_dev_info {
 
       uint32_t max_texel_buffer_range_elements;
       uint32_t max_storage_buffer_range_bytes;
+
+      /* On some HW alias.tex may hang when predicated (i.e. between
+       * predt/predf and prede).
+       */
+      bool alias_predication_quirk;
+
+      /* There seems to be a HW bug where a dummy prefetch sam.s2en always
+       * reads its src2 from fiber 0. This may cause faults when fiber 0 is a
+       * helper and helpers are disabled. We work around this by keeping
+       * helpers enabled until after such sam.s2en.
+       */
+      bool prefetch_sam_helpers_quirk;
+
+      /* QCTDD13523866: when there is a main shader with single ALU
+       * instruction which has CONST access, insert dummy ALU.
+       */
+      bool QCTDD13523866_dummy_alu;
    } props;
 };
 
